<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ dollar, monetary conditions steady ahead of MPS.</title>
<headline>NZ dollar, monetary conditions steady ahead of MPS.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Currency market notes at 8.00 a.m. (2000 GMT), one hour before RBNZ Monetary Policy Statement.</p>
<p>* Kiwi dollar shade firmer since Budget close, at 0.6875/82</p>
<p>* TWI steady at 67.31, RBNZ's MCI index at 824.65</p>
<p>* 90-day bill rate shade up at 7.03 percent vs 7.02 pct</p>
</text>
